<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 504 OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 504 OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 242 million zlotys of the National Bank of Poland's 182-day bills and for 262 million zlotys of 273-day bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The NBP offer was set at 250 million zlotys for each paper.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
